.TH codex-desktop-bootstrap 1 "May 2026" "codex-desktop 0.2.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
codex-desktop-bootstrap \- build and install the local Electron desktop payload
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B codex-desktop-bootstrap
[\fIbuild-electron-local options\fR]
[\fIpath/to/Codex.dmg\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B codex-desktop-bootstrap
builds the local Electron desktop payload for the current user and installs it
into the standard user-local app root used by
.BR codex-desktop .
.PP
The package installs the launcher and bootstrap tooling, but not the upstream
desktop payload itself.
.PP
Run this command as your desktop user, not as root.
